**Short answer:**  
Travelodge PLUS Dublin sits inside a **franchise structure**:  
- The **hotel itself** is operated in Ireland by **Tifco Hotel Group**, under a **franchise agreement** with **Travelodge Hotels Limited (UK)**.  
- The **parent company** at the top of the Travelodge corporate stack is **T&L Holdco Limited**, with **Thame & London Limited** acting as an intermediate holding company.  
  [Hotel Management Network](https://www.hotelmanagement-network.com/news/travelodge-launches-new-dublin-hotel/)  [Travelodge](https://www.travelodge.co.uk/nw/sites/default/files/THAME_AND_LONDON_LIMITED.pdf)

