## **Corporate Structure — Clean Mapping**

### **1. On‑the‑ground operator (Ireland)**  
- **Tifco Hotel Group**  
  - Privately held Irish hospitality group  
  - Manages **all Travelodge properties in Ireland**, including Travelodge PLUS Dublin  
  - Holds the **franchise agreement** with Travelodge since 2016  
  [Hotel Management Network](https://www.hotelmanagement-network.com/news/travelodge-launches-new-dublin-hotel/)  [LinkedIn](https://ie.linkedin.com/company/tifco-ltd)

### **2. Brand owner / franchisor (UK)**  
- **Travelodge Hotels Limited**  
  - UK‑based hotel brand  
  - Operates ~600 hotels across UK, Ireland, Spain  
  - Provides brand standards, systems, and franchise framework  
  [Travelodge](https://www.travelodge.co.uk/nw/sites/default/files/THAME_AND_LONDON_LIMITED.pdf)

### **3. Corporate parent structure (UK)**  
- **Ultimate parent:** **T&L Holdco Limited**  
- **Intermediate holding company:** **Thame & London Limited**  
  - Formerly the ultimate parent until 2024  
  [Travelodge](https://www.travelodge.co.uk/nw/sites/default/files/THAME_AND_LONDON_LIMITED.pdf)

